
                             RUST SUPPORT IN KERNEL
                             ----------------------

1. Introduction
----------------

Enables the kernel's Rust build support (CONFIG_RUST infra), allowing the target kernel 
and any Rust-based kernel modules, both in-tree samples and out-of-tree module recipes 
to be cross-compiled as part of the normal Yocto cross-build for the target machine.

If you need more details, Please see https://docs.kernel.org/rust/index.html

2. Usage
--------

Add this template using the following configure script option.
i.e.: --templates feature/rust-in-kernel

This will ensure the required config values are set and enables the ability to build 
Rust-based kernel modules and recipes for the target.
